CPYTHON IS BUILT MODIFIED. These drivers apply `--disable-gil` (PEP 703). On releases
whose upstream `ctypes` hard-codes `libpython%d.%d.so` (3.14.0), the Android
`ctypes.pythonapi` line is also rewritten to load `libpython3.14t.so`
(`cpython/build-cpython-314t-android.sh`); 3.14.7 upstream already loads `LDLIBRARY` and
is left unchanged. PSF-2.0 section 3 requires a statement of changes with anything you
redistribute: say that the CPython you ship is modified, and how.

